{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:@E@MLNTextWritingMode@MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"case","title":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration Case","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodehorizontal"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"If a text’s language supports horizontal writing mode, symbols with point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placement would be laid out horizontally.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"title":"MapLibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If a text’s language supports horizontal writing mode, symbols with point"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placement would be laid out horizontally."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodehorizontal","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"}],"title":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode":{"title":"MLNTextWritingMode","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode","abstract":[{"text":"The property allows control over a symbol’s orientation. Note that the property","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values act as a hint, so that a symbol whose language doesn’t support the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided orientation will be laid out in its natural orientation. Example:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"English point symbol will be rendered horizontally even if array value contains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single ‘vertical’ enum value. The order of elements in an array define priority"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order for the placement of an orientation variant."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingMode"}]}}}